---
pre-compare: sort
---

// Synthetic PAN-OS GlobalProtect records; every value is invented. The column
// order follows the PAN-OS 11.1 GlobalProtect log fields, and the event IDs
// are the documented ones; the Strata Logging Service GlobalProtect syslog
// example shows `gateway-switch-to-ssl`.
// https://docs.paloaltonetworks.com/ngfw/administration/monitoring/use-syslog-for-monitoring/syslog-field-descriptions/globalprotect-log-fields
// https://docs.paloaltonetworks.com/strata-logging-service/log-reference/network-logs/network-globalprotect-log/network-globalprotect-syslog-fields
// Gateway authentication is a logon, including for an IPv6-only client.
// Tunnel establishment, fallback to SSL, and logout are Tunnel Activity. A
// portal prelogin only starts SAML and stays a Base Event.
from_file env("TENZIR_INPUT") {
  read_lines
}
this = line.parse_syslog()
paloalto::ocsf::normalize
this = ocsf_cast(ocsf_derive(this))
this = {
  class_uid: class_uid,
  activity_id: activity_id,
  activity_name: activity_name?,
  status_id: status_id,
  status_detail: status_detail?,
  status_code: status_code?,
  user: user?,
  src_endpoint: src_endpoint?,
  dst_endpoint: dst_endpoint?,
  tunnel_interface: tunnel_interface?,
  duration: duration?,
  auth_protocol_id: auth_protocol_id?,
  is_remote: is_remote?,
  unmapped: unmapped,
}
drop_null_fields
